        "name": "Resources & Sustainable Development",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>TERI’s Resources and Sustainable Development focuses on understanding the future demand for resources and promoting pathways for resource efficiency, waste management, circular economy and driving leadership and dialogues. This platform aims to provide valuable insights, and solutions to foster a better understanding of how we can utilize resources responsibly to ensure a balanced and sustainable future.</p>",
